## Part C: Single Approval Gate

After packaging, run the repo's single approval gate with the exact task directory, submission zip, and verifier-health JSON:

```bash
python3 verifier_health.py --task-dir tasks/<task-name> --output-json /tmp/<task-name>-verifier-health.json
python3 approve_task.py --task-dir tasks/<task-name> --zip Task_Ready_To_Submit/<task-name>.zip --verifier-health /tmp/<task-name>-verifier-health.json
```

This is the authoritative repo-local hard-task approval gate. The mechanical gate (static checks, collapse check RC1-RC7, submission-zip validation, manifest verification, zip/source parity, verifier_health) is always blocking. There is no trial layer in this gate — the platform runs its own trials after upload.

